name: Link Analysis utility showcase
tagline: "A seeded electricity revenue-protection Link Analysis demo - meter tampering behind one contractor, illegal reconnections, account churn, a grow-house load and prepaid token fraud, planted among 1 000 premises with benign look-alikes"
description: "The electricity revenue-protection (non-technical loss) Link Analysis demo as a Space Template, Basic tier. Eight synthetic feeds (premise, customer_account, meter_read, transformer_read, field_visit, service_order, prepaid_vend, payment; 12 months from 2025-10-01 in data/inbox, the next month in data/staged; 1 000 premises on 40 transformers, 12 of them metered) are landed by eight Collectors and Pipelines. The utility_links Job folds them into ONE link Dataset (src, dst, kind, ts, amount, kwh, event_date, via) of six link kinds; the transformer_loss Job balances each metered transformer against its premises per month. Planted stories (ground truth: tools/gen-la-utility-data.ground-truth.json; pinned by UtilityLinksJobGoldenTest and tools/gen-la-utility-data.test.mjs): 22 premises under TX-007 and TX-019 register 40-70 % less within two weeks of a visit by contractor C-14, so loss on both transformers climbs over 15 %; 15 premises disconnected for arrears keep consuming and their reconnect orders were closed by C-22 with no payment; one bank account pays 18 accounts at 6 premises that each closed two accounts with arrears and reopened within 30 days under another name; 6 residential premises draw a flat round-the-clock load at 3-5x their street median, all paid from one account; vending point V-08 credits 40 prepaid premises 2.5-4x the kWh their money buys, mostly at night. Benign look-alikes that must not join a story: a holiday home empty every winter with no visit, 10 genuine reconnections after payment, 5 genuine changes of tenant, a heat-pump and electric-car home, and the supermarket vendor V-01. Three saved views and one saved Geo View (the Geo map needs Standard or above). Runs on every edition, Basic included: no sign-in personas, Alert Rules or Investigations. Synthetic data only."
minEdition: basic
icon: heroicons_outline:bolt
contents[6]: "8 Collectors + Pipelines + Datasets (12 months landed, 1 month staged)", "utility_links Job + Dataset (6 link kinds, kwh, via)", "transformer_loss Job + Dataset (monthly energy balance)", "3 saved views (contractor C-14, churn by bank account, vendor V-08)", "1 saved Geo View (loss by transformer area)", "5 planted stories with benign look-alikes"
